apply copy-environment task using "oc apply -f copy-environment.yaml
apply pipeline using "oc apply -f pipeline.yaml"
create pipeline run using "oc create -f pipelinerun.yaml"
install git clone task using "tkn hub install task git-clone"
install kaniko task to build and push containers using "tkn hub install task kaniko"

also you have to install web terminal operator to install kaniko and git-clone tasks

before starting  pipeline run you have to create docker credentials 

create yaml file fot docker credentials

apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: docker-credentials
data:
  config.json:{value}

to get "value" you have to run command 

cat ~/.docker/config.json | base64 -w0
